WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.875
In the previous verses of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:34.500
Lord Krishna explained how the soul

3
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.208
moves from one body

4
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:40.416
to another, and experiences the world there 

5
00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:44.291
through the new mind and senses.

6
00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:46.125
Now in verse 15.10

7
00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:48.333
He raises a question –

8
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.666
if this journey is continuously happening,

9
00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.000
why can most people

10
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.916
not see this process

11
00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:56.000
of the soul?

12
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:06.666
‘Utkramantam sthitam vapi bhunjanam
va gunanvitam.’

13
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:10.375
Sometimes the soul departs from the body,

14
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:14.333
sometimes it remains within it, and
sometimes under sattva, rajas,

15
00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:15.958
and tamas

16
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:18.708
it experiences sense-objects.

17
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:21.625
‘Vimudha nanupasshyanti.’

18
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:23.083
Those caught in delusion

19
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:26.291
cannot see this journey of the soul.

20
00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:29.166
Lord Krishna says – although

21
00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:32.500
this movement of the soul is
happening continuously,

22
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.916
only the jnana-chakshushaha – that is,

23
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:39.291
those with the eye of wisdom – can see it.

24
00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:40.666
Those whose vision

25
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:44.583
has been trained through scripture,
philosophical reflection,

26
00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:46.250
and self-contemplation

27
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.041
can see

28
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.791
what ordinary eyes cannot.

29
00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:55.416
They understand that we are 
not only this body –

30
00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:58.791
the one that eats, sleeps, and works.

31
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:00.000
Behind it

32
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.041
is the soul,

33
00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:04.000
and this soul, pulled by the gunas of prakriti,

34
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.000
keeps moving

35
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.791
from one state

36
00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:09.083
to another.

37
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.833
But the vimudhah –

38
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:14.125
those caught in delusion – cannot see this.

39
00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:14.958
Why?

40
00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:17.750
Because their vision is covered by
vasana, pride,

41
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:19.875
and desire.

42
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:24.500
They are attached only to
their personal satisfaction.

43
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.916
They are like a drunk person

44
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:29.958
who thinks he is dancing, while

45
00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:34.000
in reality he is stumbling and falling.

46
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.083
Similarly, a person caught

47
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:40.250
in enjoyment thinks –
‘I am having a great time.’

48
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.916
But they cannot see that in reality

49
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.708
they are being dragged by their own tendencies

50
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:48.625
and senses.

51
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:52.208
Their pleasure is mixed with pain.

52
00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:56.166
And they do not understand
that they have become

53
00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:57.958
a puppet of circumstances.

54
00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:01.250
It is just like a puppet that cannot see its strings

55
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:05.250
and believes itself to be free.

56
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.708
Lord Krishna says –

57
00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:09.458
such a person cannot see the truth.

58
00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:12.333
Not because the truth is invisible,

59
00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:17.041
but because their vision itself is covered.

60
00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:20.375
But one who attains jnana-chakshushaha –

61
00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:22.541
their eyes open.

62
00:03:22.541 --> 00:03:24.333
They can clearly see

63
00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:27.833
that at the time of death the
soul leaves the body,

64
00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.875
during life it dwells within the body,

65
00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:34.416
and even while living, under the influence of the three gunas

66
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:38.541
it is compelled to experience the world.

67
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:41.500
These gunas are like coloured glasses,

68
00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.083
tinting all of the soul’s experiences.

69
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:47.166
Lord Krishna is saying –

70
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:50.041
we must develop jnana-chakshu.

71
00:03:50.041 --> 00:03:50.750
Without it

72
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.708
we cannot see the truth of existence.

73
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:56.125
And when these eyes open,

74
00:03:56.125 --> 00:04:00.125
we can distinguish between soul and body,

75
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:01.083
and recognise

76
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:04.291
the difference between true joy and bondage.

77
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:08.416
This clarity is the first step toward liberation.

78
00:04:13.625 --> 00:04:15.125
Some truths

79
00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:18.916
are so subtle that ordinary

80
00:04:18.916 --> 00:04:22.791
eyes cannot see them.

81
00:04:22.791 --> 00:04:26.833
To see them, one needs not just vision,

82
00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:29.125
but to listen with an open mind.

83
00:04:29.125 --> 00:04:33.541
I told Arjun – most people

84
00:04:33.541 --> 00:04:37.333
cannot see the soul’s journey,

85
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:42.916
because their vision is covered.

86
00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:44.541
True vision

87
00:04:44.541 --> 00:04:47.583
comes through scripture –

88
00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:50.666
through deep and attentive listening.

89
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:54.791
That listening which is done with humility,

90
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:58.041
and then tested in life.

91
00:04:58.041 --> 00:04:59.083
If you

92
00:04:59.083 --> 00:05:03.083
limit yourself only to the senses –

93
00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:08.375
what can be touched, tasted, and measured –

94
00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:11.291
the deeper mysteries of life

95
00:05:11.291 --> 00:05:13.875
will elude you.

96
00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:17.708
You will not even know who you are

97
00:05:17.708 --> 00:05:20.458
and where you come from.

98
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:23.208
This is not blind belief –

99
00:05:23.208 --> 00:05:25.208
it is the knowledge

100
00:05:25.208 --> 00:05:28.583
to be received with humility

101
00:05:28.583 --> 00:05:32.083
and tested on life’s touchstone.

102
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:35.375
When you listen with humility,

103
00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:40.375
reflect deeply, and bring what you have learned

104
00:05:40.375 --> 00:05:44.208
into your life, then

105
00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:47.291
the inner eye begins to open.

106
00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:50.750
You begin to recognise

107
00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:54.500
what remains hidden from others.

108
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.791
You begin to understand truths

109
00:05:57.791 --> 00:06:03.083
that ordinary vision can never see.

110
00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:06.666
So I say – listen carefully.

111
00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:13.208
The truth you hear with humility today,

112
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:18.250
will become the light of your life tomorrow.

113
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:27.416
In family life, the easiest thing

114
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.541
is to judge quickly.

115
00:06:30.541 --> 00:06:35.041
One harsh word from a family member,

116
00:06:35.041 --> 00:06:38.500
a cold glance, or sudden anger –

117
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.791
and you react without thinking.

118
00:06:42.791 --> 00:06:46.708
For children, scolding is not

119
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:51.916
the best approach – compassion is.

120
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:56.000
Behind anger there may be fear.

121
00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.541
Behind silence there may be hidden pain.

122
00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:01.583
If you only react

123
00:07:01.583 --> 00:07:04.083
to the visible behaviour,

124
00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:07.333
the confusion will only deepen.

125
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:12.291
But if you pause and try to understand,

126
00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:14.708
everything can change.

127
00:07:14.708 --> 00:07:17.041
You may have seen this.

128
00:07:17.041 --> 00:07:20.583
Sometimes a child comes home from school

129
00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:22.083
and stays quiet.

130
00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:23.875
Studies suffer.

131
00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:27.083
Exam marks fall.

132
00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:29.375
At that moment, reacting immediately

133
00:07:29.375 --> 00:07:32.208
and punishing or scolding them

134
00:07:32.208 --> 00:07:33.708
is never right.

135
00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:38.791
Listening and understanding them with warmth

136
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:44.166
can reveal the real reason the
child has withdrawn.

137
00:07:44.166 --> 00:07:47.041
Almost always, not scolding

138
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:48.833
but compassion

139
00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:52.875
is the best approach.

140
00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:57.041
For children, true love is not in correcting

141
00:07:57.041 --> 00:08:00.958
or blaming. It is

142
00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:03.333
in watching with patience

143
00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:08.666
and listening with an open heart.

144
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:09.833
When you

145
00:08:09.833 --> 00:08:12.625
try not only to judge but

146
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.750
to understand,

147
00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.416
trust is born,

148
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:21.041
wounds begin to heal,

149
00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:24.166
and the home becomes that place

150
00:08:24.166 --> 00:08:28.708
where everyone feels safe.

151
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:34.000
This is where family bonds deepen.

152
00:08:39.125 --> 00:08:41.500
At work, most people

153
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.333
chase only results –

154
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:48.125
targets met, work done on time,

155
00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:51.916
praise received. But

156
00:08:51.916 --> 00:08:55.208
very few stop to ask –

157
00:08:55.208 --> 00:08:59.166
‘What is actually happening here?’

158
00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:02.541
I have said – most people,

159
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:07.291
with their vision covered by delusion, cannot see

160
00:09:07.291 --> 00:09:10.208
how the soul moves under the influence

161
00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:13.208
of prakriti’s gunas, struggles,

162
00:09:13.208 --> 00:09:16.416
and experiences.

163
00:09:16.416 --> 00:09:18.125
Only

164
00:09:18.125 --> 00:09:22.083
those with the eye of wisdom can see this.

165
00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:26.958
This same truth applies to your career.

166
00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:31.583
Surface results are only part of the story.

167
00:09:31.583 --> 00:09:35.083
True leadership begins when

168
00:09:35.083 --> 00:09:39.625
you learn to recognise the hidden reality –

169
00:09:39.625 --> 00:09:41.625
like

170
00:09:41.625 --> 00:09:44.291
what is driving people,

171
00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:47.083
what is shaping the culture,

172
00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:49.125
which invisible forces

173
00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:51.958
are influencing decisions.

174
00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:57.208
Do not only react to data or trends.

175
00:09:57.208 --> 00:10:01.166
Train your inner vision –

176
00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:04.375
so that you can see

177
00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:07.666
what is hidden from ordinary eyes.

178
00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:11.083
The fear hidden behind aggression,

179
00:10:11.083 --> 00:10:13.958
the exhaustion hidden behind enthusiasm,

180
00:10:13.958 --> 00:10:18.041
and the confusion hidden behind certainty.

181
00:10:18.041 --> 00:10:20.250
Growth lies not in running

182
00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.041
faster, but in seeing more deeply.

183
00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:28.000
When you develop this awareness,

184
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.791
you are no longer a piece on
the board of circumstances.

185
00:10:31.791 --> 00:10:35.750
You become a creator of change –

186
00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:41.541
clear, calm, and one step ahead.

187
00:10:41.541 --> 00:10:44.666
This is true vision.

188
00:10:44.666 --> 00:10:48.625
This is true success.

189
00:10:48.625 --> 00:10:49.875
Reflect on this.
